{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08018","headline":"夜坐吟 · 李白","name":"夜坐吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冬夜夜寒觉夜长，沈吟久坐坐北堂。\n冰合井泉月入闺，金缸青凝照悲啼。\n金缸灭，啼转多。\n掩妾泪，听君歌。\n歌有声，妾有情。\n情声合，两无违。\n一语不入意，从君万曲梁尘飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08018.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08018","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}